{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-315",
  "title": "EasyShip vs ShipStation (2025)",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "EasyShip vs ShipStation (2025)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Easyship vs ShipStation (2025): Key Differences for Webflow Integration"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For product designers and e-commerce operators looking to support shipping from Webflow storefronts, here's a clear comparison of Easyship and ShipStation as of 2025:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Core Strengths"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easyship**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Specializes in global shipping—enables real-time carrier cost comparisons from 250+ partners and automates customs/taxes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Useful international features: automated duty calculation, customs clearance, support for a wide array of carriers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Three paid plans (Plus, Premier, Scale) ranging $29–$99/mo, plus a free tier. Known for significant shipping discounts for international deliveries."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- User-friendly interface, branded tracking pages, and messaging capabilities."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Most suitable for e-commerce brands with international focus and direct-to-consumer (D2C) strategy."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Some users report package overcharging and occasional platform bugs.youtube[clickpost+1](https://www.clickpost.ai/comparison/easyship-vs-shipstation)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**ShipStation**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Excels in automation and integrations: works seamlessly with 40+ carriers and 34+ e-commerce platforms, including Webflow via third-party connectors."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Designed for U.S.- and Canada-based businesses; best for high-volume shippers and businesses with complex fulfillment workflows."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Advanced rules engine automates carrier selection, order splitting/merging, and facilitates warehouse routing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Offers branded tracking pages, custom shipping rules by weight/destination and strong reporting tools."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Paid plans start at $9.99/mo and scale to $99.99/mo, but prices rise sharply for enterprise/high-volume needs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Platform occasionally criticized for higher cost for small businesses and limited international features compared to Easyship.[clickpost+1](https://www.clickpost.ai/comparison/easyship-vs-shipstation)youtube"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Webflow Compatibility"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Neither ShipStation nor Easyship have native Webflow integrations**. Connecting to Webflow generally involves using middleware platforms (such as Zapier, Make, or custom code) that push order data from Webflow forms or CMS collections to the shipping software.[discourse.webflow](https://discourse.webflow.com/t/shipping-products-from-a-webflow-site-what-a-nightmare/224473)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Both offer robust **API access**, making it possible to build custom workflows for Webflow-based stores—important for designers/developers with advanced needs."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User Experience & Support"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easyship:** Easy to set up, strong for global logistics, but may lack deep automations and post-purchase communication channels that ShipStation offers.[clickpost+1](https://www.clickpost.ai/blog/easyship-vs-shipstation)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**ShipStation:** Fantastic for scaling or managing multiple sales channels; more granular control and advanced automation, but smaller businesses may find pricing less competitive or unnecessary.[capterra+1](https://www.capterra.com/compare/155621-170399/ShipStation-vs-Easyship)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Summary Table"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Feature | Easyship | ShipStation |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Focus | Global/D2C Shipping | Automation, U.S./Canada |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Carrier Support | 250+ (global/international) | 40+ (U.S./Canada-centric) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Best For | International brands, D2C | High-volume, multichannel stores |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Pricing | Free–$99/mo | $9.99–$99.99+/mo |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Automation | Basic (rules, customs) | Advanced (rules, splitting, etc) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Custom Tracking | Branded, multi-lingual | Branded, order-level control |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Webflow Integration | API/third-party only | API/third-party only |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Known Weaknesses | Occasional bugs/glitches | Cost scales up quickly |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Recommendation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Choose Easyship if:** Your business ships internationally, especially D2C, and values customs/duty automation and cost savings."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Choose ShipStation if:** You focus primarily on U.S. or Canadian orders, need deep automation, and operate multiple sales channels with complex logistics."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If strong Webflow compatibility is critical, expect to use **Zapier, Integromat, or custom API development** with either platform. Your choice should reflect business volume, destination focus, and required automation depth.[discourse.webflow](https://discourse.webflow.com/t/shipping-products-from-a-webflow-site-what-a-nightmare/224473)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xn_uJ0PDCKE](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xn_uJ0PDCKE)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vkSolwVz-h0](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vkSolwVz-h0)"
        }
      ]
    },
