        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. [https://stackreaction.com/compare/easyship-vs-shippo](https://stackreaction.com/compare/easyship-vs-shippo)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. [https://www.softwareworld.co/compare/shipstation-vs-easyship/](https://www.softwareworld.co/compare/shipstation-vs-easyship/)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nyxTOi3c8LM](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nyxTOi3c8LM)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "9. [https://www.capterra.com/compare/155621-170399/ShipStation-vs-Easyship](https://www.capterra.com/compare/155621-170399/ShipStation-vs-Easyship)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "10. [https://stackreaction.com/compare/easyship-vs-easypost](https://stackreaction.com/compare/easyship-vs-easypost)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Scope: integrations, checkout behavior, ops, returns, pricing, gotchas."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Use ShipStation** if you’re on Webflow. It’s the **only official, native app** with a maintained V2 connection and documented features. ([Webflow](https://webflow.com/apps/detail/shipstation), [ShipStation Help](https://help.shipstation.com/hc/en-us/articles/5101261717147-Webflow))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easyship** is strong for cross-border (rates/duties at checkout) on platforms it supports **natively**—but **Webflow isn’t one of them**, so you’d rely on middleware and custom API flows. ([support.easyship.com](https://support.easyship.com/hc/en-us/articles/19240712538258-Shipping-Rates-at-Checkout-Feature?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [Webflow Help Center](https://help.webflow.com/hc/en-us/articles/33961431933843-Configure-shipping-methods-for-different-shipping-zones))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Official Webflow App** (Auctane); update to **Webflow V2** required in 2025. ([Webflow](https://webflow.com/apps/detail/shipstation), [ShipStation Help](https://help.shipstation.com/hc/en-us/articles/5101261717147-Webflow))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-60",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Syncs orders, maps statuses, and **pushes tracking + carrier/service** back to Webflow. ([ShipStation Help](https://help.shipstation.com/hc/en-us/articles/5101261717147-Webflow))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Supported fields: customer email/phone, item images/options, order & item weights, requested service, etc. ([ShipStation Help](https://help.shipstation.com/hc/en-us/articles/5101261717147-Webflow))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**No native Webflow app.** Connect via Zapier/Make/Pipedream (e.g., “New Webflow order → create Easyship shipment”). ([Zapier](https://zapier.com/apps/easyship/integrations/webflow/1268739/create-easyship-shipments-for-new-webflow-orders-effortlessly?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [Stackreaction](https://stackreaction.com/easyship/integrations/webflow?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [Pipedream](https://pipedream.com/apps/webflow/integrations/easyship/create-shipment-with-easyship-api-on-e-commerce-inventory-updated-from-webflow-api-int_qjsrBnrn?utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-63",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use **Webflow Ecommerce API** to set fulfillment + tracking back on the order. ([developers.webflow.com](https://developers.webflow.com/data/v2.0.0/reference/ecommerce/orders/update-fulfill?explorer=true&utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-64",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Viable, but more moving parts (automation platform costs, error handling)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Webflow checkout doesn’t do carrier-calculated live rates natively.** You define zones/methods with flat/price/qty/weight rules. ([Webflow Help Center](https://help.webflow.com/hc/en-us/articles/33961431933843-Configure-shipping-methods-for-different-shipping-zones))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-66",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "ShipStation’s **rate shopping** still helps **post-purchase** for label selection—not at Webflow checkout. ([ShipStation](https://www.shipstation.com/pricing/))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-67",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Easyship’s “Rates at Checkout” + “Duties & Taxes at Checkout” are product features, but **not applicable to Webflow’s native checkout**. ([support.easyship.com](https://support.easyship.com/hc/en-us/articles/19240712538258-Shipping-Rates-at-Checkout-Feature?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [Easyship](https://www.easyship.com/rates-at-checkout?utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-68",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**ShipStation:** Imports orders from Webflow and **updates Webflow** with status, tracking number, carrier/service on shipment. ([ShipStation Help](https://help.shipstation.com/hc/en-us/articles/5101261717147-Webflow))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easyship:** Webflow → Easyship via automation; **write back** tracking via Webflow API (examples shown by Pipedream templates). ([Pipedream](https://pipedream.com/integrations/update-order-with-webflow-api-on-tracking-status-updated-instant-from-easyship-api-int_xOsGBP8x?utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-70",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**ShipStation:** Branded self-service **Returns & Exchanges portal** with analytics/RMA workflows on paid tiers. ([ShipStation](https://www.shipstation.com/returns-management/?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [ShipStation Help](https://help.shipstation.com/hc/en-us/articles/38629459557531-Customer-Returns-Portal?utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-71",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easyship:** Can **generate return labels** (incl. prepaid); portal experience usually via partners/stack. ([support.easyship.com](https://support.easyship.com/hc/en-us/articles/19257458514450-How-to-Create-Prepaid-Return-Labels?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [Easyship](https://www.easyship.com/create-return-labels?utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-72",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**ShipStation:** Handles customs docs; BYO carrier accounts for international. ([ShipStation](https://www.shipstation.com/pricing/))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-73",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easyship:** Strong cross-border stack (DDP workflows, duties/taxes calcs, courier comparison). Again: **not surfaced at Webflow checkout**. ([support.easyship.com](https://support.easyship.com/hc/en-us/articles/19233986332178-Import-Duties-and-Taxes-Explained?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [Easyship](https://www.easyship.com/?utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-74",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**ShipStation:** Free (10 shipments), **Starter $14.99** (50/mo), Standard/Premium scale up; Returns/Exchanges & Inventory on higher tiers. ([ShipStation](https://www.shipstation.com/pricing/))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-75",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easyship:** Free + paid tiers (Plus/Premier/Enterprise). Features like **Rates at Checkout**/**Duties at Checkout** gated to higher tiers. ([Easyship](https://www.easyship.com/plans))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**ShipStation (native):** Install app → connect store → set rules/automations → print labels → tracking auto-posts back to Webflow. ([Webflow](https://webflow.com/apps/detail/shipstation), [ShipStation Help](https://help.shipstation.com/hc/en-us/articles/5101261717147-Webflow))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-77",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Easyship (middleware):** Webflow order trigger → Easyship shipment action → on label/ship, **update Webflow order** via API with tracking + fulfill. ([Zapier](https://zapier.com/apps/easyship/integrations/webflow/1268739/create-easyship-shipments-for-new-webflow-orders-effortlessly?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [developers.webflow.com](https://developers.webflow.com/data/reference/ecommerce/orders/update?utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-78",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Fastest, least brittle path:** ShipStation. Official connector, good returns, stable support. ([ShipStation Help](https://help.shipstation.com/hc/en-us/articles/5101261717147-Webflow))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-79",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**You need Easyship specifically (e.g., existing contracts, global lanes, DDP policy):** Expect **middleware + API work**; budget for maintenance. ([Zapier](https://zapier.com/apps/easyship/integrations/webflow/1268739/create-easyship-shipments-for-new-webflow-orders-effortlessly?utm_source=chatgpt.com), [developers.webflow.com](https://developers.webflow.com/data/reference/ecommerce/orders/update?utm_source=chatgpt.com))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-80",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Don’t assume “live rates at checkout” on Webflow—it’s **manual rate rules**. If a vendor claims otherwise for Webflow, ask for a demo. ([Webflow Help Center](https://help.webflow.com/hc/en-us/articles/33961431933843-Configure-shipping-methods-for-different-shipping-zones))"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-81",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "App store copy can be generic (e.g., references to Shopify checkout on a Webflow app page). Validate against docs. ([Webflow](https://webflow.com/apps/detail/shipstation))"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}